notes.notes:
New content:

- New upgrades: new unlockable upgrades were added for projectile ricochet with the minigun and the fire cannon, and for triple shots with the fire cannon;
- New Arcade mechanic: the Arcade and Long-Run modes now deliver your upgrades and special items in a random generated way, making every match a different experience;


Adjustments:

- Balanced difficulty: the parameters over the enemies and the player's weapons have been updated to make the game difficulty more balanced;

🎁New content🎁

- "Roguelike" mode: new gameplay mode, more challenging, with upgrades chosen randomly and achieved by hitting a score goal. Your score is also ranked and can be shown in the game's Steam community;
- "Long-run" mode: new gameplay mode, with the same mechanics as the common "Arcade", but saving your progress whenever you want to leave the game, and then returning from the point you left, your progress will be syncronized with Steam Cloud;
- Selectable difficulties: in case the game's normal pace is too slow or too quick for you, try the diferent difficulties ("Easy", "Normal", "Medium" and "Hard") for the "Arcade" and "Long-run" gameplay modes;


🛠Adjustments and Upgrades🛠

- Configuration system: your audio, video and language configurations are now been saved and stored on Steam Cloud;
- New Leaderboard table: the ranking screen at the Main Menu now has the tables for 2 gameplay modes ("Arcade" and "Roguelike");
- Graphic interface upgrade: the panels of the UI were remade with a better resolution;
- Planes: the collision boards for the planes have been updated for a better coherence with theis sprites;

New content:

- Achivments: 41 new achivments were added to the game, with challenges of survival and weapon mastery;


Adjustments:

- Time system: the cenary changes between day and night in a dynamic way, acording to an in-game clock;
- Upgrade messages: a few messages for received upgrades were corrected;

New contents:

- Special Itens: Every 11 survived waves, the player receives a special item of single use, to help him in a moment of need. The inventory has 2 itens: the "Sky Cleaner" drone and the "Laser Overcharge" modification;

- Tutorial Screen: More cards were added to the tutorial screen at the "Play" section of the main menu, now with all basic concepts of controls, enemies and itens received by the player;


Adjustments:

- Dynamic difficulty: Now your match's difficulty depends on your skill levels, the longer it takes for you to be damaged, the harder the game will be;

- Upgrade Icon: The icon for the upgrade box has been update for a better understanding;


Patches:

- Airplane sound;
- Upgrade message control;

New content:

- Leaderboard Screen: Linked to the Leaderboard Steam, feature shows players with scores close to the player;

- Tutorial screen: Shows the player’s basic controls with animated cards, and information of enemy soldiers;


Changes:

- Save Methods: It is now possible to save your current score as soon as you leave, either by closing the match, restarting or closing the game via the pause menu;

- Health bar: Now, the color of the life bar follows the health status of the player, becoming red when it falls below 40% health;

- Points table: The table in the upper left corner, containing the points, number of waves and remaining enemies, now has a slight transparency, allowing for a more comfortable view of the game;


Corrections:

- Movement of the aircraft in round 50;
- Saving scores;
